Core Concepts

Unified Ingestion Core (UIC)

Processes GAIA‑DR3 stellar motion fields and JWST transit spectroscopy into normalized tensor streams.

Deterministic Blackwell Kernel

A multi‑layer solver replacing stochastic subgrid models with deterministic formulations across cosmology, climate, and biosphere layers.

Voxel Universe Grid

A 3D lattice encoding dark matter scalars, star formation rates, gas density, temperature, and radiation flux.

Planetary Biosphere Layer

Atmospheric circulation, oceanic flow fields, biosphere density, and habitability metrics — all resolved inside the same voxel substrate.

Selective Gradient Encryption (SGE)

Encrypted tensor streams for secure ML‑related gradient propagation.

Compute Fabric

Conceptual 100,000‑node, 521 PB HBM architecture enabling unified multi‑domain simulation.

